[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3704025703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114500#issuecomment-3704025703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114500","id":3704025703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cxvJn","user":{"login":"DenisSalem","id":4476506,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NzY1MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4476506?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem","html_url":"https://github.com/DenisSalem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DenisSalem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-01T19:23:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T11:47:12Z","body":"# Fix investigation\n\nShader is constructed in [scene/resources/material.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8ebeb4ddae0f9cd91fcb58239b2974bf15873be/scene/resources/material.cpp).\n\nInvolved snippet of code to fix \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8ebeb4ddae0f9cd91fcb58239b2974bf15873be/scene/resources/material.cpp#L1858-L1862\n\n`fade_distance` is then injected in `smoothstep` here :\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a8ebeb4ddae0f9cd91fcb58239b2974bf15873be/scene/resources/material.cpp#L1872\n\n---\n\nWhat we would want is to do something like [this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113486/files)\n\nWe can 